    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to introduce a beautifully, presented, three bedroom residence in lovely condition throughout with an array of welcoming features wonderfully located in a delightful rustic setting where the country atmosphere is virtually unspoilt.This beautiful home is presented as you would wish for immediate occupation and offers quality, warm, welcoming features and extras that must be viewed to be fully appreciated. The residence boasts an efficient, spacious layout with generous living accommodation. \nThis super home is positioned in a unique, charming setting within the grounds of Knockanally House with wonderful views of the surrounding countryside away from the hustle and bustle yet close to Newtown Village and convenient to Kilcock, Enfield and Johnstown Bridge where one can find all the ingredients for modern living. Dublin City and its surrounding areas are easily accessible via frequent bus and rail links available nearby and proximity to the M4 Motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.5m x 2.0m\nWith tiled flooring, alarm keypad, telephone point.\n\nLounge - 6.0m x 4.3m\nWith feature fireplace, laminate flooring, recessed lighting, tv point.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.0m x 5.0m\nWith fitted Shaker style kitchen, Zanussi gas hob, Hotpoint electric oven, Neff electric oven, extractor hood, Bosch integrated dishwasher, island/breakfast bar, tiled floor, side door access, tv point.\n\nUtility Room - 2.1m x 2.0m\nWith fitted Shaker style units, Bosch washing machine, tiled floor.\n\nW.C. - 1.4m x 1.4m\nWith wc, vanity whb, tiled floor, tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 1 - 6.0m x 5.1m\nWith fitted wardrobes, carpet, balcony.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.5m x 2.0m\nWith Triton pump shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled walls,folding shower screen, mirror, shaving light, wall mounted electric heater.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.4m x 2.7m\nWith fitted wardrobes, carpet.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.1m x 3.1m\nWith fitted wardrobes/shelving, laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.9m\nWith bath, wc, whb, tiled floor, part tiled walls, mirror shaving light, wall mounted electric heater.\n\nLanding - 3.5m x 1.2m\nWith carpet, airing cupboard, attic hatch.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Constructd c.2005</li><li>Floor area 128 sq.m. approximately</li><li>Electric heating, underfloor heating on ground floor</li><li>PVC double glazed windows</li><li>Curtains, blinds, lightfittings</li><li>Pine 4 panel internal doors</li><li>Alarm (monitored 30 per month)</li><li>Attic floored for storage</li><li>Evertex painting externally</ul>"
      },
